{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884","id":4801813338,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tf_CQ","number":120884,"title":"Fix AreaLight overflow and NaN artifacts","user":{"login":"Mingxi-Z","id":100094557,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfdSXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100094557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Mingxi-Z","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-03T08:30:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T09:51:44Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T09:20:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120884","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #120742\r\n## Summary of changes:\r\nFixes the issue in the following steps:\r\n- FP16 overflow during distance calculations. Evaluates `length()` operation in float and stores the value in half for `dist`.\r\n- FP16 overflow for `light_length * light_length` when the length is over 256 approximately. Calculates the value in float.\r\n- FP16 overflow for `light_attenuation_raw` and `light_attenuation_ltc` from `get_omni_attenuation()`. Adds  `float get_omni_attenuation_highp()` and store the result in float for the two variables.\r\n- `light_attenuation_raw * light_length *light_length` can overflow FP32. Splits the `light_length_squared` from attenuation, and directly applying it to ltc factors.\r\n- In `light_process_area()` `SPECULAR_TOON` path, the contribution to `diffuse_light` can overflow FP32. Avoid NaN value produced by `intensity == 0.0` case.\r\n- `mix()` operation of `out_color` and `fog` can result in `NaN` when `out_color` contains Inf value, depending on the underlying implementation. On metal, the underlying formula of `mix(x, y, a)` can be either `x + (y – x) * a` or `(1 -a) * x + a * y`. The former can result in NaN when `x` is `Inf`. Replaces `mix()` with the second form explicitly and avoids `fog.a == 1.0` case.\r\n## Testing\r\n- I tested my code changes with MRP from #120742 in Forward Mobile. I increased the size of the plane and added planes with different materials for testing.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86670bb9-d188-4f4c-bcbd-08781ae7cd08\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- Some artifacts are not mobile-specific since the value overflows under FP32. The `mix()` operation with fog also influenced omni and spot light.","closed_by":{"login":"Mingxi-Z","id":100094557,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfdSXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100094557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Mingxi-Z","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120884/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}